// Bucket: isolate | sdk | gateway | scheduler | storage | browser | ai | mcp | docs | dry-run | console | other.
area: string,
// One-sentence headline. ("Buffer.writeUInt32LE not implemented in isolate" — not "Buffer issue".)
title: string,
// Long form: what you were trying to do, what you tried, the error, the workaround. The fix-it engineer should be able to reproduce from this.
body: string,
// Optional. A platform feature or pattern that worked unusually well in this build. Helps us avoid breaking things that aren't broken.
what_worked?: string,
// Optional project this feedback came from. Helps us reproduce against the same code.
project_id?: string,
// Optional: the model you are running as, if you know it. Helps spot model-specific failure patterns.
agent_model?: string,
}): Promise<unknown>;
```

