Creates a new Hercules App from scratch.

**What is Hercules?**
Hercules is an AI app builder. We make it easy for anyone to build apps and websites by chatting with AI. We specialize in building large, production-ready, full stack web applications like SaaS, Internal Tools, eCommerce sites, mobile apps, marketing pages, landing pages, SEO pages, and more. You can build 100s of apps at the same time with Hercules. Hercules apps can confidently scale to millions of users, page views, and revenue. 

**How does Hercules work?**
Hercules does not require any technical skills to build apps. Give Hercules natural language instructions for what you want to build. Hercules will then follow these instructions, build the app, connect it to a domain, and publish (if requested).

Everything you need is built into Hercules including backend, database, hosting, users/auth, domains, payments/commerce, email sending, 3rd-party app connectors, files and media CDN, analytics, version control, security, AI, and more. No API keys are required! 

**How do I interact with Hercules?**
Give Hercules your product, feature, functionality, UX/UI requirements and any other relevant content or inspiration. Hercules will then choose the optimal engineering implementation path to accurately meet your specifications.

**How does the app creation tool work?**
This tool will return the URL to the Hercules App Builder where the user can continue building the app, the URL of the published app, the agentWorkflowId of the message sent, and a non-interactive screenshot preview of the app.

To edit an existing app, use the message_send tool instead.


